{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as an adorable Capybara, kidnapped by poachers and waking up in a horrifying laboratory\u2026 but not in reality\u2014in Limbo! Now you\u2019re a translucent ghost, and to reunite with your friends, you\u2019ll have to endure nightmarish traps, devious challenges, and the dark secrets of this place.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2a Devious Traps:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spikes</strong> that suddenly shoot up or <i>chase you</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saws</strong> (chainsaws, buzzsaws) and projectile-firing hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treacherous platforms</strong> that vanish or kill on contact.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Level Modifiers:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flipped screen</strong> (for masochists).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slippery surfaces</strong> (even harder!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful (and harmful) buffs</strong> bought with <i>deaths</i>\u2026 but if you don\u2019t spend them, the boss grows stronger!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Style &amp; Atmosphere:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world starts bleak and monochrome, but as you progress, it bursts into color\u2014a symbol of hope in this brutal trial.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897170?t=1755537475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897170/5da62365dd16a6be7089c5a343a28121d02cb085/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755537475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897170/25d1677e758dc39a61e628ce8821f0e7e4bf1bf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755537475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets